# Strip Jupyter/Zeppelin notebook outputs before they are staged, so cell outputs
# (plots, large dataframes) are never committed. This rule travels with the repo;
# each clone must still activate the filter once:
#     pip install nbstripout && nbstripout --install
# Without nbstripout installed the filter is simply skipped (outputs not stripped),
# so this file is safe for collaborators who have not set it up.
*.ipynb filter=nbstripout diff=ipynb
*.zpln filter=nbstripout
